      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "当前为受限访问：只能匹配你选中的联系人，不能代表整本通讯录。请在系统设置中允许完全访问后再做完整清理。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Limited access: only the contacts you select can be matched — this doesn't represent your whole contacts. Allow full access in Settings before a full cleanup."
          }
        },
