    "显示的是网络往返（RTT），不是语音时延；未测得或已过期的数值不会当作当前值。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shown is network round-trip (RTT), not voice latency; unmeasured or expired values are never current."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示的是网络往返（RTT），不是语音时延；未测得或已过期的数值不会当作当前值。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
