            "value": "打開 CallRelay"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通过已授权的网关线路拨打电话。可选择线路；不选择时使用现有默认线路偏好。线路不可用会在 App 内说明，绝不改用蜂窝电话。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过已授权的网关线路拨打电话。可选择线路；不选择时使用现有默认线路偏好。线路不可用会在 App 内说明，绝不改用蜂窝电话。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Call through an authorized gateway line. Optionally pick a line; otherwise the existing default line preference applies. Unavailable lines are explained in the app — a cellular call is never placed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "透過已授權的網關線路撥打電話。可選擇線路；不選擇時使用現有預設線路偏好。線路不可用會在 App 內說明，絕不改用手機電話。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 CallRelay 中打开发短信界面并预填收件人、内容与线路；发送需在 App 内确认。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 CallRelay 中打开发短信界面并预填收件人、内容与线路；发送需在 App 内确认。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open the CallRelay composer prefilled with recipient, body and line; sending must be confirmed in the app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 CallRelay 中打開發簡訊介面並預填收件人、內容與線路；傳送需在 App 內確認。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开 CallRelay 的拨号键盘、短信或语音留言。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 CallRelay 的拨号键盘、短信或语音留言。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open the CallRelay dialer, messages or voicemail."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打開 CallRelay 的撥號鍵盤、簡訊或語音留言。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
